{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in compact deterministic specifications. The policy gives priority to forward progress in clear conditions, uses one-shot obstacle recovery states, keeps action states robust to noncritical path_clear self-loops under open-loop pulse semantics, and reserves full_rotate only for a dedicated last-resort front-blocked branch.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion with two plant automata",
    "Use one policy specification with perception states and one-shot action/recovery states",
    "Bias clear conditions to move_forward, use directed turns for side obstacles, and use move_backward only as a brief front-obstacle escape",
    "Make all states total on uncontrollable events and keep obstacle states free of move_forward/random_walk"
  ],
